((date 2026-11-17) (slug virgin-supply-one-basis-correctness)
 (hypothesis
  "Not a performance hypothesis. Records the USER-DIRECTED (2026-11-17 11:00 PT, option (a), #3664 comment 6960893659: flip on correctness, whatever D_end shows) correctness flip of virgin_supply_basis Legacy_mixed -> One_basis, in Weinstein_strategy.config, Stock_analysis.config and every sexp default. The defect (#3664, the #3659 sibling audit): the virgin-crossing test and the overhead-supply grade compared the raw breakout with the warehouse sketch (520-week high, histogram), which since #2145 is back-adjusted, so on history it already carries every split and dividend the name pays LATER. A name below its 10-year high therefore passed as virgin when it later split or paid dividends: the selection read the future. In fbt-05's S run 374 of 2,816 trades (13 %, an upper bound) passed the virgin test only through the mix, carrying 31-47 % of the record's summed contribution per seed. The fix landed behind the default-off knob in #3666; the paired K=5 run (observatory arm vsb-1, read in dev/experiments/observatory/reads/vsb-1.md, #3671) measured how much of the record band the mix carried. This entry exists because the flip bypasses the normal R3 gate (experiment-flag-discipline.md) as a correctness fix, and the ledger is what the next experiment session reads: every arm written after 2026-11-17 that does not pin virgin_supply_basis runs on One_basis, NOT on the mixed basis every earlier recorded run used.")
 (base_scenario
  "observatory lane vsb-1 at 96cacbe20 (#3668 merge, includes #3666): the record config rk-kK (K = 5 tie seeds) = S, paired per seed with S + ((virgin_supply_basis One_basis)) on one build; top-3000 PIT v12, 26y; TRIPWIRE MATCH S k0 trades.csv md5 0928cfe4; V6 OK (k0-k4 against S); LIVE 5 of 5 seeds; no sp500 cell. Paired-golden watch: every golden the flip moves, run PAIRED (virgin_supply_basis Legacy_mixed vs One_basis) at the flip PR build per config-default-blast-radius (the table is the dispatcher's, in the PR body).")
 (window_id top3000-pitv12-2000-2026-record-kseed5)
 (baseline_label vsb-S)
 (variants
  (((label vsb-S-k0) (config_hash legacy-mixed-seeded-k0@96cacbe20) (aggregate (((mean_sharpe 0.6338) (mean_calmar 0.4028) (mean_return_pct 1472.76) (mean_max_drawdown_pct 27.22)))))
   ((label vsb-S-k1) (config_hash legacy-mixed-seeded-k1@96cacbe20) (aggregate (((mean_sharpe 0.6609) (mean_calmar 0.4675) (mean_return_pct 1678.33) (mean_max_drawdown_pct 24.55)))))
