   ((label vsb-1-k3) (config_hash one-basis-seeded-k3@96cacbe20) (aggregate (((mean_sharpe 0.4824) (mean_calmar 0.2547) (mean_return_pct 692.23) (mean_max_drawdown_pct 31.91)))))
   ((label vsb-1-k4) (config_hash one-basis-seeded-k4@96cacbe20) (aggregate (((mean_sharpe 0.5970) (mean_calmar 0.3742) (mean_return_pct 1095.34) (mean_max_drawdown_pct 26.24)))))))
 (verdict Inconclusive)
 (notes
  "READ THE VERDICT FIELD CAREFULLY. NOT an Accept: verdict type is the closed variant Accept | Reject | Inconclusive; Inconclusive is the house label for a human-gated R3 override (precedents 2026-09-03-exit-basis-d1d2-correctness, 2026-08-24-stops-basis-book-faithful, 2026-08-18-entry-ticket-clock26-promotion). The paired run does NOT favour the flip on return, and the flip is taken anyway: it removes a look-ahead, and the five One_basis cells become the new record band. WHAT HAPPENED: the user decided 2026-11-17 11:00 PT to flip on correctness, whatever D_end shows (#3664 comment 6960893659); only a collapsed supply path or an invalid run would have stopped it, and the read checked both. EVIDENCE (dev/experiments/observatory/reads/vsb-1.md, #3671): D_end per seed (vsb-1 against S, log growth) -0.2098, -0.3475, -0.3317, -0.5106, -0.3752, median -0.3475, all five negative, so the mixed basis carried ~0.35 log of the record (median seed ends ~29 % lower without it; seed range 19-40 %); max drawdown worse on 4 of 5 seeds (median +6.35 pp); S reproduces the record band (median ln(1+R) 2.755 against 2.78) and every vsb-1 seed sits below S's lowest seed. Validity: same build 96cacbe20, TRIPWIRE MATCH, drift-none, V6 OK on the pairs, LIVE 5 of 5. Collapse check: under One_basis 102 of 103 entry decisions of a 3-year k0 pair carry a supply score against 114 of 114 under S, so the path is live, not collapsed (one entry fell back to the v1 grade, cause not traced; the open panel-path current_raw_close follow-up covers the one route only One_basis has). The pre-registered flag is none (seeds_neg60 = 0: each seed is negative in 48-59 % of years, below the 60 % bar); per the pre-registration it is descriptive, because the arm measures a defect's share of the record, not a dial. NEW RECORD BAND at the flip HEAD, with no re-run: vsb-1's five cells, ln(1+R) 2.546, 2.531, 2.332, 2.070, 2.481 (median 2.481, sample SD 0.20); the old figure 2.78 (#3467) carried the look-ahead. The flip PR is checked against vsb-1 k0 trades.csv md5 3ee10dca319e54a85f5e0a7842d8c537, which the flipped default must reproduce. FAITHFULNESS (weinstein-faithful-core W1/W2): a correctness fix to how new high ground (weinstein-book-reference.md Buy Criteria) is measured, one price basis for the test, not a new dial; the spine is untouched; Legacy_mixed stays selectable ((virgin_supply_basis Legacy_mixed)) to reproduce the old path. DEVIATIONS FROM THE NORMAL GATE, declared: (1) no WF-CV surface and no confirmation grid (promotion-confirmation.md): the flip corrects a measurement defect rather than promoting a mechanism, and a surface on the mixed basis cannot rank it; (2) no ledger Accept (R3): this entry is the record; (3) the paired read is a single K=5 cell pair on one universe, so it sizes the defect and does not rank the flip. CONSEQUENCE FOR EARLIER READS: msd-12, msd-18, fbt-05 and cap-40 were paired against an S that carries this look-ahead; their D_end values are not re-based, and arms run after the flip pair against the new S. The lane tripwire in dev/experiments/observatory/lane.sh (S k0 trades.csv md5 0928cfe4) pins the old default and moves to vsb-1 k0 once the flip merges. BLAST RADIUS: the default config arms overhead_supply and virgin_crossing_readmission, so every strategy cell that reads a warehouse sketch moves (goldens-affected reports AFFECTS-ALL); the paired golden table is the dispatcher's, in the PR body, with the paired-run-done label. FOLLOW-UPS OWED: the paired golden run and its table (#3664 keeps verify/pending until it lands); harden the #2973 split-week mis-scale under One_basis (registry rows for #2973 stay open); the live weekly snapshot generator builds its Stock_analysis config from Stock_analysis.default_config and does not thread config.virgin_supply_basis (it now inherits One_basis)."))
